摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"DeepSeek Harness usage dashboard with API balance, daily spend, external vision-call accounting, per-model stats, call logs, cache rate, TTFT, and CSV export.","id":"gh:1334023305","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-usage-dashboard-plus","slug":"1HelloMan1/dsh-usage-dashboard-plus","topics":["dashboard","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm-observability","usage","usage-stats","vision"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"DeepSeek Harness usage dashboard with API balance, daily spend, external vision-call accounting, per"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"-model stats, call logs, cache rate, TTFT, and CSV export."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-usage-dashboard-plus"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"A fork of dsh-usage-dashboard with **external vision-call accounting**: a sidebar-footer widget for "},{"id":"p4s2","text":"DeepSeek Harness (dsh) showing your **DeepSeek API balance** and **today's spend**, estimated from s"},{"id":"p4s3","text":"ness (dsh) showing your **DeepSeek API balance** and **today's spend**, estimated from session logs."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"This is now the only actively maintained usage-dashboard repository. The former `dsh-stats-dashboard"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"` implementation has been fully merged into Plus; do not install both statistics plugins in the same"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ntation has been fully merged into Plus; do not install both statistics plugins in the same profile."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## What \"Plus\" adds"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"- **Counts external vision-model calls** (e.g. `dsh-vision-fallback`'s Mimo V2.5 requests) into the "},{"id":"p7s2","text":"today-spend stats via an optional JSONL usage log — the base package only counts calls recorded in D"},{"id":"p7s3","text":"SH session logs.\n- Bundles a **pricing entry for `mimo-v2.5`** (opencode Zen GO rates) so those call"},{"id":"p7s4","text":"s get a cost estimate out of the box (override via `prices`)."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **API balance** — resolves the DeepSeek key through the DSH credentials service and queries the ba"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"lance endpoint (cached).\n- **Today's spend (est.)** — scans session logs (and the external usage log"},{"id":"p9s3","text":") for today's token usage × price table.\n- **Sidebar footer widget** — `余额 ¥xx · 今日 ¥xx`, click to o"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"pen a detail card (calls, tokens, per-model breakdown, pricing notes).\n- **Peak/off-peak pricing sch"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"edule** — date-gated DeepSeek rate tables (2026-08-17 onward).\n- **Full usage dashboard** — per-prov"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"ider/per-model calls, latency, TTFT, throughput, input/output/cache tokens, cache rate, and estimate"},{"id":"p9s7","text":"d cost.\n- **Call-log analysis** — filter and search by session, provider, and model; inspect recent "},{"id":"p9s8","text":"calls and export filtered rows as CSV.\n- **Inherited Stats implementation** — the `usageDashboard` s"},{"id":"p9s9","text":"ession projection, 500-row call-log cap, whole-session model aggregates, and replay-safe historical "},{"id":"p9s10","text":"statistics are included in Plus.\n- **No build step** — host half (`lib/index.js`) + browser bundle ("},{"id":"p9s11","text":"`lib/client.js`) via the `dsh.client` mechanism."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Migrating from dsh-stats-dashboard"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"1. Remove or disable the old `dsh-stats-dashboard` plugin from the `web` profile.\n2. Install `dsh-us"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"age-dashboard-plus`.\n3. Restart `dsh web` and hard-refresh the Settings page."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Plus reads the existing session logs, so historical sessions do not need to be migrated. Do not keep"},{"id":"p12s2","text":" both statistics plugins enabled; the old repository is retained only as a historical source and is "},{"id":"p12s3","text":"no longer maintained independently."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The npm package ships `dsh.bundle` and `cordis.patch.yml`, so the install command inserts `usage-das"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"hboard` into the target profile without manual directory copies or patch editing."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Verify:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"Then hard-refresh the GUI (`Cmd+Shift+R`) — the footer widget appears next to 设置/Settings."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"All settings live under the `usage-dashboard` namespace in `~/.dsh/settings.yaml` (hot-reloaded):"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"### External usage log (`externalUsageLog`)"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"`dsh-vision-fallback` (and other plugins that call models outside the DSH session-log pipeline) can "},{"id":"p23s2","text":"append one JSON line per external call:"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"Default path: `<dsh home>/vision-fallback/usage.jsonl`. Set `externalUsageLog: off` to disable."},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Development"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"MIT — forked from dsh-usage-dashboard (MIT)."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
